Test` control node and go into the `Texture` property.\n- Try to change `Color` exported property in the resource => the popup closes after the slightest change.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77061ad0-6b05-4bed-8932-7665ac6ddd63)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MiniPrjImageRefreshLoseFocusBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19591467/MiniPrjImageRefreshLoseFocusBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Natahan-Tatan","id":88054177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDU0MTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88054177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan","html_url":"https://github.com/Natahan-Tatan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104979/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104979/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}